ected by default and can be tapped or clicked to apply the suggestion, streamlining input and enhancing usability.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Chips can show multiple interactive elements together in the same area, such as a list of selectable movie times, or a serie of email contacts.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Best suited for category-based filters that do not require additional visual elements.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOSuggestionChip"}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misosuggestionchip","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOSuggestionChip","kind":"identifier"}]}}}